 {'check':'Fitting scope','question':'Were assessment recordings excluded from required fits?','reason':'File naming is not proof of nested fitting.','method':'All 20 inner +80 extra subfold memberships; deterministic outer0/inner0/sub0 source trace; outer0 F6 scaler parity','source':'fitting_scope_checks.json, original sources/manifests','result':'No required assessment overlap found; inspected sources match training identities','uncertainty':'Not statistical','limitation':'No replay of all optimizer/sample events; original S1 statistical model/scaler not retained at its original fit','consequence':'State scope and PROVENANCE_GAP explicitly, not universal execution certification','status':'COMPLETED_WITH_PROVENANCE_LIMITATIONS'},
 {'check':'Task boundary','question':'What inputs are available when, and do windows obey their annotations?','reason':'Separate retrospective outcome classification from prospective warning.','method':'27180 timestamp/count checks,4530 saved frame-index checks; source inspection and overlap follow-up','source':'boundary_checks.json, input_availability.csv, overlap_followup.json','result':'No selected timestamp outside annotation window; closed endpoints; three overlapping primary pairs within recordings','uncertainty':'Annotation semantics/human labels pending','limitation':'Whole-recording cadence metadata; raw signal extraction not reexecuted; trailing idle cannot be decided from timestamps','consequence':'Retrospective annotation-row task; targeted adjudication before any correction','status':'COMPLETE WITH QUALIFICATIONS'},
 {'check':'Metadata diagnostics','question':'Can permitted action/duration/coverage predict failures?','reason':'Quantify a plausible alternative explanation without new architecture search.','method':'Three fixed logistic models; same nested recording folds, training-only transforms/calibration/thresholds','source':'D0/D1/D2 keyed OOF files and fitting logs','result':'D1 AP improves over D0; D2 decreases from D1; every diagnostic remains below U1/F2','uncertainty':'Paired recording2000-draw intervals, post-hoc','limitation':'Does not prove original model mechanism; historical action baseline specification differs','consequence':'Add metadata caveat without claiming sensor information absence','status':'COMPLETE'},
 {'check':'Action sensitivity','question':'Does actual F2 gain generalize across actions?','reason':'Complementarity is not actual subgroup fusion improvement.','method':'All four actions; whole-recording draws then filter; support/invalid draw counts','source':'per_action_fusion.csv','result':'All AP point deltas positive; only insert marginal AP interval excludes zero','uncertainty':'Marginal exploratory intervals; place22 failures/21 recordings','limitation':'Small subgroup precision, no simultaneous positive claim or new macro-AP headline','consequence':'No uniform per-action gain assertion','status':'COMPLETE'},
