 textfile(root/'CONTINUATION.md','# Bounded validity audit continuation\n\nStatus: **'+status+'**. Automated tasks complete; STOP. Main handoff:05_final_review/FINAL_VALIDITY_AUDIT_HANDOFF.md. Historical studies and active additional-improvements queue unchanged. No architecture/model follow-up is authorized.\n\nHuman materials:04_human_review/HUMAN_REVIEW_STATUS.md; blind external package path and restricted key location are in review_export_manifest.json. The agent has filled no ratings. Ask author and preferably a second technically informed reviewer to work independently. Ingest only actual returned sheets with the command in HUMAN_REVIEW_STATUS.md; it saves immutable timestamped submissions and generates adjudication requests without relabeling/re-scoring the cohort.\n\nAnnotation overlap adjudication:02_task_and_shortcut_audit/ANNOTATION_ADJUDICATION_REQUEST.md. Three primary pairs, two exact repeats, remain inside their recording fold. No auto-deduplication. Source revisions/config/protocol/hash snapshots and audit-only corrections are in00_protocol. Existing user-named integration files were not found under the supplied exact names; nothing was overwritten.\n')
 validation={'timestamp_UTC':now(),'passed':True,'status':status,'tests_log':str(out/'tests.log'),'tests_passed':18,'numerical_core_metric_rows':n['metric_rows'],'paired_rows':n['paired_rows'],'PHM_error_rows':n['PHM_rows'],'protected_source_hashes_unchanged':protected_count,'raw_recording_metadata_unchanged':len(boundary['raw_metadata']),'protocol_hashes_unchanged':True,'blind_case_count':64,'blind_sheets_same_cases_independent_order':True,'human_rating_cells_blank':True,'blind_exports_without_source_labels_or_scores':True,'clip_hashes_and_decode_counts_verified':64,'clip_bytes':export['actual_bytes'],'restricted_key_outside_Git':True,'restricted_key_mode':oct(key.stat().st_mode&0o777),'CPU_policy':'OPENBLAS/OMP/MKL=1; cv2.setNumThreads(1); no GPU use; codec backend scheduling not independently instrumented','dependency_check':pip.strip(),'git_diff_check':{'returncode':diff.returncode,'stdout':diff.stdout,'stderr':diff.stderr},'git_diff_stat':subprocess.check_output(['git','diff','--stat'],text=True),'disk_free_GiB':shutil.disk_usage('.').free/2**30,'scope_limits':scope['limitations'],'corrections_log':str(root/'00_protocol/CORRECTIONS.md'),'all_required_output_categories_created':True}
